WEBVTT

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:07.920
We have finished preparing

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.380
the data from the game between
Souji Jikukawa and Kaito Daimon.

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.740
We shall now implement
the aforementioned plan.

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:20.270
I believe we should also move the
experiment to the next phase.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.210
I shall lead its direction to that man.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.550
Yes, understood,

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.410
Mr. Klondike.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:00:46.980
Lost

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.110
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:54.030
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:55.950
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:59.280
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.990
Found

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:05.250
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.710
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.550
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:15.630
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:18.970
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.890
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:01:20.890 --> 00:01:22.600
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:24.930
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:01:24.930 --> 00:01:27.140
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:29.520
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:32.980
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.690
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.530
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:39.410
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.530
It's now or never

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.620
That is what they say

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.700
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:48.370
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:01:48.370 --> 00:01:49.540
That is what they say

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:51.710
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:55.210
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:56.420
That is what they say

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:58.840
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:05.020
The Devil Has Returned

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.460
Bam!

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.550
Erena!

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:13.520
Antoinette!

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.390
What?

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:16.850
Don't "What?" us!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.030
What the hell's with that?!

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:26.070
You hired those cooks, didn't you?

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.400
They're chefs.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.730
What of it?

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:32.500
First-rate chefs from
three-star restaurants.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:34.860
Three stars, sparkly sparkly!

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:36.300
Look, just look!

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:39.080
We can enjoy food from ultra-fancy

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.550
restaurants here at school!

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:45.180
What's more, it costs the same as
the menu we've had up till now!

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:47.560
What're you callin' a fancy restaurant?!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.800
You ask us, we prefer...

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.480
The old dude's menu we've had all along!

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:55.140
Old dude... Old dude...

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:57.260
What are you saying?
Old dude... Old dude...

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.240
The food from a first-rate chef is

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.010
more delicious, of course.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:02.550
Shaddap!

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:05.740
Put the old dude back in
charge of cooking right now!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.860
Miss Himekawa...

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:10.520
The student council president!

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.670
What? Erena did?

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:18.090
She hired some workers and had them
clean the school grounds?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.470
There's no need to thank-

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:23.230
Cleaning school grounds
is the students' job.

00:03:23.560 --> 00:03:24.850
Excuse me?!

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.680
That's not all.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:30.600
You're shooting monster
shows at Root Kindergarten.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:34.360
And hiring pro bands to
cheer on the Athletics Club.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.360
Stop this selfish behavior!

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:38.600
"Selfish behavior"?!

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:39.890
I just-

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:41.320
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:44.320
Bring back our old dude, dammit!

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:47.410
You're the one who transferred here,

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:50.320
so please obey Root Gakuen's rules.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.540
I..It's not like I wanted
to transfer here.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:01.080
Well, my apologies for acting selfishly.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.200
I was so out of line.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.120
Wait right there, Miss Himekawa!

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.370
Tamaki sure is determined.

00:04:08.370 --> 00:04:10.180
Determined!

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.660
I'm so bored.

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:22.950
Please stop that, Melancholy.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.620
This is because you always lose.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:37.410
It seems he's run wild again.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:46.660
Kaito...

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:50.100
I have to begin puzzle time with Kaito!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:54.310
Otherwise, Mama will...

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.350
Freecell...

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.740
Get everyone together.

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.850
We've been given new orders.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:14.480
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.860
We're on suspended leave.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.830
Now that you're all here,

00:05:32.830 --> 00:05:34.730
allow me to introduce you.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:39.000
This is your director, Herbert Mueller.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:42.890
Director?

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:44.070
This guy?

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.200
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:46.720 --> 00:05:51.450
Herbert Mueller, former Chief of
POG Far East Headquarters.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:56.410
He built traps into his puzzles,
sought to kill the Solvers.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:59.960
Yet, he failed in his attempt
to take the life of Kaito Daimon.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.050
He was held accountable,
lost his position...

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.880
and fled into the arms
of the Orpheus Order.

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:11.890
Cease your idle chatter!

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:15.780
A man like this as our director?

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:17.730
I refuse to accept it.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.170
Same here.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.340
Nuts to you!

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:25.190
You're saying you'll
do puzzles with Kaito?

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:28.030
What if I am?

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:29.770
I won't allow it.

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.520
Kaito...

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:35.830
The one who will begin puzzle
time with Kaito is me!

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.660
I shall test you,

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:47.260
see just what manner of man you are.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.240
It's Lightning Position.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:56.150
Players may make the same
moves as knights in chess.

00:06:57.540 --> 00:07:00.460
From their position, they change the
color of panels in eight directions,

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.440
making their own play field.

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:06.320
I see, it's a simple but good puzzle.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.900
First up is blue, Mr. Doubt.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:14.220
Next is red, Mr. Herbert.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:17.330
Now then, exhibition game...

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:18.540
Play.

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.720
It's settled, yes?

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:35.080
Winner: Mr. Herbert.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.000
No way!

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:38.670
Doubt lost?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.890
Who is that guy?

00:07:42.090 --> 00:07:44.670
That's not possible!

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.470
An Orpheus Ring!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.310
No way, a Replica?

00:07:52.310 --> 00:07:55.200
I lost to a Replica?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.650
Doubt could never lose to a Replica!

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.060
Then, that's...

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.820
Yes, it's real.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:06.300
I have returned from the depths of Hell,

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.960
to become a Phi-Brain child!

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.520
To have my revenge against Kaito Daimon!

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:16.710
I have known ignominy and despair,

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:19.070
and now I shall make him know it!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:29.980
Thanks for the food!

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.920
I swear...

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.460
Maybe I was too hard on Miss Himekawa.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:47.750
I think I've been too
strict since becoming

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.750
student council president.

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:54.080
It's not as if Miss Himekawa
had bad intentions.

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:57.700
Yes. It's like she wants
to get along with everyone,

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:00.890
but doesn't know what to do.

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.370
Yeah...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:05.920
All right, I'll talk
to her again tomorrow.

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:06.900
Okay!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.400
No New Messages

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.460
Honestly!

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:20.580
Just what have they been doing

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.700
since transferring me here?

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.030
After all I did...

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:33.300
For everyone's sake.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.270
Why?

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.700
Why isn't it me?

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.570
Why is it someone like him...

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:55.010
who does puzzles with Kaito?!

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.000
Mr. Freecell...

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:09.530
Hasn't there been something that
you've thought strange?

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.450
The Orpheus Ring is a thing of legend.

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:19.760
How were we able to
acquire so many of them?

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.100
I shall tell you, and you alone,

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:30.050
what Mr. Klondike's true intentions are.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.850
Friggin' Erena.

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:47.330
Why's she calling us out
to a place like this?

00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:50.280
She's filming something, maybe?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.610
Hey, Erena!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:53.860
We're here!

00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:55.080
Where are you?

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.320
It's been some time, Kaito Daimon.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:00.580
Who're you?!

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:03.760
I'm sure you don't know of me,

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:06.890
but I know you very well.

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.320
I am Herbert Mueller,

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:14.150
he who was formerly
Chief of POG Far East Headquarters.

00:11:14.610 --> 00:11:16.060
The POG?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.510
So you're the one who called us?

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.930
Where's Erena?!

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:33.360
Dammit, quit hidin' and come on out!

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.040
Calm yourself.

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:45.680
I am Wu of the Inner Guard,
Orpheus Order South American branch.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:49.120
I am No, also of the Inner Guard.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.400
Orpheus Rings!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:53.950
They're twins.

00:11:54.480 --> 00:11:56.650
They shall be your opponents.

00:11:57.380 --> 00:11:59.140
They are unmatched in team play

00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:03.060
in all the Orpheus Order,
unbeatable in tag competition:

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:04.280
the brothers Wu and No.

00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:06.060
Team play?

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.710
But I'm the only one here!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:11.410
Nonoha Itou accompanies
you, does she not?

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.990
Huh? Me?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:17.910
It is good that you again join forces
with your dear companion.

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.840
Cut the crap!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.410
No way I'm acceptin'
a challenge like that!

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:24.630
Is that a wise thing to say?

00:12:34.670 --> 00:12:36.110
What is this place?!

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:37.470
Erena!

00:12:37.470 --> 00:12:38.610
Erena!

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:42.110
Kaito! Nonoha!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:45.830
In ten minutes,
that steel girder will retract into the wall.

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.160
Do you know what happens then?

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:52.760
You're a smart man, so I don't
think I have to tell you.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:57.130
If you want to stop it,
you must win the game.

00:12:57.980 --> 00:13:00.570
You know Lightning Position, yes?

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:03.450
The button to stop the girder on which

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:06.090
Antoinette stands is beneath the central panel.

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.460
And you get the panel by capturing
the most board space, huh?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.100
You catch on fast, good.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:17.300
Also, standing atop the
switch is forbidden.

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.760
Now, let's begin, Kaito Daimon.

00:13:19.760 --> 00:13:20.730
Nonoha!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.810
Listen up: I'll take care of everything.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:27.220
For now, just move, and don't stop!

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:28.450
Got it.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:31.150
As thanks for accepting this challenge,

00:13:31.150 --> 00:13:33.450
I shall let you move second.

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:37.150
In this game, it is more advantageous
to attack from behind.

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:40.510
Now then, tag game:

00:13:41.070 --> 00:13:42.050
Play.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.130
Erena!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:53.080
Players move in the same
pattern as chess knights.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.250
From their position,
they can move in eight directions,

00:13:56.250 --> 00:14:00.260
changing panels to their own color.

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:05.810
If the panels ahead are
the opponent's color,

00:14:05.810 --> 00:14:08.520
they can make one of them their own.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.240
I know what the first move is, so...

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:22.910
"To free man from the yoke of the gods."

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:26.220
Any who would interfere with
that great objective...

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:27.390
...will be eliminated.

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.380
"Free man," my ass!

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:37.230
Takin' people hostage is
just friggin' cowardly!

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:39.170
She is not a hostage.

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:40.840
She shall join with you.

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.330
But we are your enemies.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:45.640
Hurry up and win.

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:46.740
Come on!

00:14:47.170 --> 00:14:49.060
It's my turn next, huh?

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:52.120
Um, where should I go?

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.200
Nonoha, hurry!

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:01.950
That woman, she's an amateur.

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:04.250
But we shall show no mercy.

00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:39.750
It's my turn again.

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.920
We have to hurry up and win,

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:43.350
or Erena will...

00:15:47.740 --> 00:15:51.260
But I don't get it!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:52.630
Nonoha!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:55.540
Anywhere's fine, just move!

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.040
Nonoha!

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.670
What is it? Do you give up?

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:05.130
Your companion is weak-willed.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:09.100
If you like, you may call on another.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:11.030
If you can do so in time, that is.

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:20.420
He has another companion right here.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:34.330
Rook!

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.390
Rook!
Rook!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:37.010
Master Rook!

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.290
Wh..What?

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.630
Rook, what are you doing here?

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:47.150
We can talk later, Kaito.

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:49.110
Herbert,

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:51.370
I shall now be his partner.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.850
You have no objection
to this change, correct?

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:58.350
I'm counting on you, Rook.

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:02.280
You are Rook Banjo Crossfield, eh?

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.960
A not unworthy opponent.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.910
Here we go, Rook!

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:11.460
Puzzle time...

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.050
Let's begin!

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.250
In a two-against-two
battle, we brothers...

00:17:16.250 --> 00:17:17.820
...cannot be beaten.

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.680
Wu! No!

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:37.820
I don't care if you lose,
just guard that button!

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:42.440
We shall battle fairly,
and most surely win.

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:44.120
Don't be cocky!

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:48.400
You little bastards just
shut up and do as your told!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.400
No thank you.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.710
We don't care for how you do things.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.490
Damn you, Wu! No!

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:00.970
Erena!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.790
It's speedin' up!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:04.930
It hasn't been ten minutes yet!

00:18:05.440 --> 00:18:09.730
I don't believe I said the
girder's speed wouldn't increase.

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:12.640
Suffer, Kaito Daimon!

00:18:12.640 --> 00:18:13.780
Damn!

00:18:13.890 --> 00:18:18.740
Look on powerlessly as your
precious comrade dies!

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:21.620
Not to worry, Kaito.

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:28.120
Erena!

00:18:32.890 --> 00:18:34.380
Now what?!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.540
Good job, Bishop.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.790
All right, let's resume the puzzle!

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:44.670
You're gonna keep going?

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:47.590
Now we can concentrate on the puzzle.

00:18:47.850 --> 00:18:51.240
It's been a while, so I'd like
to enjoy a puzzle with you, Kaito.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:54.900
R..Rook is a fool for puzzles too?

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.650
Here we come, Orpheus Order!

00:18:57.960 --> 00:18:59.410
Suits us fine.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:16.050
Incredible, they're twins all right.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:20.080
They move with a perfect understanding
of the other's thoughts.

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.390
They truly act as one.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:23.800
Still...

00:19:24.310 --> 00:19:26.220
Kaito and Rook aren't losing.

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:27.460
Why?

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.920
Those twins have probably
learned together,

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.770
spent time together since childhood.

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:36.290
Master Rook and Kaito are different.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:38.990
They spent many years apart.

00:19:39.730 --> 00:19:42.950
But because of that,
they've become stronger,

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.270
have greater clarity of thought...

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:50.430
They think of each other,
know what to do for their partner.

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:53.320
For their partner...

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:54.750
This ends it.

00:20:02.240 --> 00:20:05.640
49 to 48, we win!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:06.890
They did it!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:08.270
We lost?

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:09.940
Us?

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.500
Kaito?

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.200
That was fun.

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:20.130
Kaito Daimon, Rook Banjo Crossfield...

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:25.300
It seems our paths shall again cross.

00:20:30.610 --> 00:20:33.440
Intelligence work across the globe?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:35.700
Yes, Master Rook has been

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:38.530
investigating the Orpheus
Order's activities,

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:41.330
all the while incurring their attacks.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:45.090
Those guys went after Rook too?

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:48.390
It was Master Rook who ordered Antoinette

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:50.740
to transfer to Rook Gakuen.

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:54.650
Should the need arise,
she would act as point of contact.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:55.920
For the reals?!

00:20:55.920 --> 00:20:58.150
Ooh, that's smart!

00:20:58.150 --> 00:20:59.750
I told you, didn't I?!

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:02.260
I didn't transfer because I wanted to!

00:21:02.660 --> 00:21:04.310
Oh, really?

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.160
R..Really!

00:21:08.080 --> 00:21:10.790
Tomorrow, I'll apologize to Tamaki.

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:13.960
I mean, Miss Tamaki.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:19.630
So, Rook, what brings you to Japan?

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:23.280
There's something I want
to give you, Kaito.

00:21:25.260 --> 00:21:27.200
Wretched Rook!

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.890
Wretched, foolish twins!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:30.420
Damn, damn, damn!

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:31.040
Pitiful.
Damn, damn, damn!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:33.000
Pitiful.
Why don't you do as I say?!

00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:34.340
I won't forgive you!

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:37.060
You have insulted me!

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:44.570
Replicas?

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:49.120
Mr. Herbert's and Mr. Doubt's Rings

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.620
are nothing more than replicas.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.150
What a crock.

00:21:54.150 --> 00:21:55.870
It is not a lie.

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:58.010
There is only one true Ring:

00:21:58.590 --> 00:22:02.460
the one that you wear, Mr. Freecell.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:08.540
Mr. Klondike has devised
a special mission for you, sir.

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:12.430
The time will come when
you may move at will.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:17.030
Therefore, please bear
with this a while longer.

00:22:23.260 --> 00:22:28.480
We'll be able to do puzzles
together again, Kaito.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.220
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.040
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.650
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.660
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:27.400
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.770
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:34.430
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.430
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:42.740
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.060
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.380
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.800
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.260
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:02.110 --> 00:24:04.360
Master Rook, there shall
be a dog next time.

00:24:04.360 --> 00:24:06.410
What's with you all of a sudden, Bishop?

00:24:06.410 --> 00:24:07.620
It can't be helped.

00:24:07.620 --> 00:24:11.490
The addition of a puzzle dog will
surely lead to increased popularity.

00:24:11.490 --> 00:24:14.120
All right, let's do a Pomeranian!

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:17.330
No, I prefer a purebred shepherd.

00:24:17.330 --> 00:24:19.200
Next time, "Atonement"

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:26.630
Atonement

00:24:19.730 --> 00:24:21.440
No, I'd prefer a poodle.

00:24:21.440 --> 00:24:23.300
Woof-woof! Wait, who's a poodle?!

00:24:23.670 --> 00:24:24.390
Sir.
